{% comment %}
  Discovery Box Builder
  - 5 slots with dynamic progress timeline
  - Desktop: Auto-open first slot, sequential product filling, auto-advance to next slot
  - Mobile: Original flexible behavior (no auto-select, manual slot selection)
  - Direct to checkout redirect
  - Selection flow: Brand -> Product
  - Requires exactly 5 items to checkout
{% endcomment %}

{{ "bundle--five-favourites.css" | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<div class="perfume-bundle-section">
  <div class="builder-layout">
    {%- comment -%} The sizes, and each size's perfume collection: boxes.json, five_favourites {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- capture fb_sizes -%}{%- render 'region--content', key: 'boxes.five_favourites.perfume_collection_per_size.__keys' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
    {% render 'bundle--sidebar', title: section.settings.heading, subtitle: section.settings.subheading, capacity: 5, show_savings: true %}

    {% render "bundle--product-grid", show_size_step: true, sizes: fb_sizes %}
  </div>
</div>

{%- comment -%}
  Prices, by the same rule as the box builder (sections/bundle--box.liquid):
  the product is Five Favourites in the region's content/boxes.json; what each
  size costs is its Shopify variant; the standard price a saving is shown
  against is the variant's compare-at price or, until the store sets one, the
  box's standard_price_per_size. Money is formatted by the store.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  capture fb_handle
    render 'region--content', key: 'boxes.five_favourites.product_handle'
  endcapture
  assign fb_handle = fb_handle | strip
  assign fb_parent = section.settings.bundle_product | default: all_products[fb_handle]
  capture fb_pricing_json
    for variant in fb_parent.variants
      assign k = 'boxes.five_favourites.standard_price_per_size.' | append: variant.title
      capture reference_price
        render 'region--content', key: k
      endcapture
      assign reference_price = reference_price | strip
      assign standard = nil
      if variant.compare_at_price > variant.price
        assign standard = variant.compare_at_price
      elsif reference_price != blank
        assign standard = reference_price | times: 100 | round
      endif
      echo variant.title | json
      echo ': { "total": '
      echo variant.price | money | strip_html | json
      echo ', "standard": '
      if standard
        echo standard | money | strip_html | json
        echo ', "saving": '
        echo standard | minus: variant.price | money | strip_html | json
      else
        echo 'null, "saving": null'
      endif
      echo ' }'
      unless forloop.last
        echo ', '
      endunless
    endfor
  endcapture
  capture fb_variants_json
    for variant in fb_parent.variants
      echo variant.title | json
      echo ': '
      echo variant.id
      unless forloop.last
        echo ', '
      endunless
    endfor
  endcapture
-%}

{% render 'bundle--strings' %}
{%- comment -%}
  Five Favourites for the script: per size its price, standard price and saving
  (formatted by the store, see above) and the box's variant; each size's perfumes
  from its collection in boxes.json (five_favourites, perfume_collection_per_size);
  and the brands to browse by (the region's data/bundle-brands.json).
{%- endcomment -%}
<script type="application/json" id="fiveFavouritesData">
  {
    "pricing": { {{ fb_pricing_json }} },
    "variants": { {{ fb_variants_json }} },
    "productsBySize": {
    {%- assign size_list = fb_sizes | split: ',' -%}
    {%- for size in size_list %}
      {%- liquid
        assign k = 'boxes.five_favourites.perfume_collection_per_size.' | append: size
        capture size_collection
          render 'region--content', key: k
        endcapture
        assign size_collection = size_collection | strip
      %}
      {{ size | json }}: [
      {% paginate collections[size_collection].products by 100 %}
      {%- for product in collections[size_collection].products %}
        {
          "id": {{ product.id }},
          "title": {{ product.title | json }},
          "vendor": {{ product.vendor | json }},
          "image": {{ product.featured_image | img_url: '300x300' | json }},
          "tags": {{ product.tags | json }},
          "variants": [
          {%- for v in product.variants %}
            { "id": {{ v.id }}, "title": {{ v.title | json }}, "price": {{ v.price }}, "sku": {{ v.sku | json }}, "available": {{ v.available | json }} }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
          {%- endfor %}
          ]
        }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
      {%- endfor %}
      {% endpaginate %}
      ]{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
    {%- endfor %}
    },
    "brands": {% render 'region--data', name: 'bundle-brands' %}
  }
</script>
<script src="{{ 'bundle--five-favourites.js' | asset_url }}"></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Perfume Bundle Builder",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "inline_richtext",
      "id": "heading",
      "default": "Build Your Own Five Favourites",
      "label": "Heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subheading",
      "default": "Add 5 items to complete your five favourites",
      "label": "Subheading"
    },
    {
      "type": "product",
      "id": "bundle_product",
      "label": "Bundle Parent Product (Optional Override)",
      "info": "Leave empty to automatically resolve by product handle ('the-five-favourites') and currency."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Perfume Bundle Builder"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
